            "value": "<p>Once per day, when an <strong>attack roll</strong> against you would deal damage that reduces you to 0 Hit Points, you may <em>Speak the Portent</em> on that attack roll even though it has already been rolled, even if your Portent is spent, and even if a fortune or misfortune effect altered it &mdash; using a value of 1. It cannot be used on your own saving throw, or on damage no attack roll dealt.</p>"
